  "schema": "caliber_u2_device_ref_v1",
  "description": "Candidate app reference for Caliber U2 (device/size_class-locked). Per-device μ/σ and piecewise median→50 anchors for NV Diameter (CV) and Dilated vessel (%). Values recomputed from manuscript reference batch CSVs (same cohorts named in phase1_collect.log header). IMPORTANT: phase1_collect.log itself does NOT log NV-CV or Dilated%; do not treat this as log-parsed.",
